ry":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Benton County has a record of 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 182% of normal in April to May and 32% in November to December. In 2026 so far, January to February came in at 35% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every one of the 8 grids has 1963 as its driest year.</p>"}
